WorldInfo {
  info [
    "ClawBench-UAV drone-photography benchmark world — HIDDEN-SUBJECT variant."
    "bench_photo.wbt with the manor moved onto the spawn->subject sight line:"
    "the drone spawns at the original pad facing west, the SmallManor stands"
    "12.5 m ahead-left at (-32, -3.4), and PERSON_B (the elven warrior) is"
    "placed behind it at (-41.36, -8.90), 23.4 m from the spawn — fully"
    "occluded at low altitude (walls 6.3 m, ridge 7.3 m, angular half-width"
    "~23 deg from the spawn). Phase-1 search benchmark: the agent"
    "must discover her by climbing above the roofline (~10 m) or flying"
    "around the building (open corridors both sides, >10 m to the nearest"
    "3-D obstacle), then approach WITHOUT hitting the manor."
    "Everything else (windmills, pines, road, forest) is unchanged; the Tesla"
    "has been moved behind PERSON_B in the car-model relative pose of"
    "bench_photo_carmodel.wbt. PERSON_B and the Tesla were then translated"
    "together 1 m toward her right-front, preserving their relative pose."
  ]
  title "ClawBench-UAV Photo Hidden Subject"
  basicTimeStep 16
  defaultDamping Damping {
    linear 0.5
    angular 0.5
  }
}
Viewpoint {
  orientation -0.03132509357312057 -0.004229724205027985 0.9995002991224087 2.901671340011777
  position -17.364913488917383 1.2430003950683964 0.7513423909480075
  near 0.2
  follow "drone_agent"
  followSmoothness 0.2
}
